nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.cannabis.trade=Drug Dealers may sell cannabis seeds for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.tobacco.trade=Farmers may sell tobacco seeds for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.coca.trade=Drug Dealers may sell coca seeds for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.hops.trade=Farmers may sell hop seeds for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.coffee.trade=Farmers may sell coffea cherries for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.peyote.generation=Peyote generates only when enabled in biomes matching both sandy and hot, or both mountain and hot. Sand is a terrain condition, not a crafting ingredient.
nei.psychedelicraft.acquire.peyote.trade=Drug Dealers may sell peyote for emeralds. The offer and price are selected by Minecraft's villager trade helper and are not guaranteed.
